<title>USA: SENSORMATIC WILL OPEN TALKS ON UNIT SALE.</title>
<headline>SENSORMATIC WILL OPEN TALKS ON UNIT SALE.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sensormatic Electronics Corp said Friday it will open discussions with potential buyers of its enterprise accounts division after discussions ended with Pinkerton Inc.</p>
<p>Sensormatic said the discussions ended because the parties were unable to reach agreement on terms.</p>
<p>On Friday, Pinkerton said the deal was quashed after extensive due diligence investigation.</p>
<p>The deal was originally announced in May. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
